msgid "Group operator terms: use the operator structure for the latest version of Qiskit bosons"
msgstr "Qiskit bosons最新バージョン向け、演算子の項のグループ化:演算子の構造を使う"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Group operator terms: use the operator structure"
msgstr "演算子の項のグループ化:演算子の構造を使う"

#. type: Plain text
